                                "sense_id": "f805862b-77c9-36c8-aebd-575ea4e421de",
                                "text": "And I noticed that there was a space at the table between the five gobleted places and those of the other six; moreover, there were only three chairs, the other seats having no backs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd039d24-8c04-49dd-831e-53e599b7bd7d",
                                "sense_id": "f805862b-77c9-36c8-aebd-575ea4e421de",
                                "text": "Flowers of magic size and lovely lustre, in tall golden vases, adorned the long, lace-spread, silver-gobleted tables. A great feast was served, too, and all was splendid—until midnight."
                            }
                        ]
